Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(630,406)}{\fs30}{\b1\c&H18213A&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H18213A&\fnGeorgia}Maomao's Diaries{\fnBaskerville Old Face}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm back in the Pleasure District, \Ntrouble keeps finding its way to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Freckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chou!\N Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, \Nyou really should be nicer to people!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this brat, coming out of nowhere with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You were bullying that old guy earlier, \Nweren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? When did I ever do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You were shoving a huge pile of grasshoppers into his mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the big sisters of the Rokushoukan looked disgusted! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(648,49)}Rokushoukan = Verdigris House
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people who really can't stand them, you know! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think doing stuff like that is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I wasn't bullying him. That was... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just making him take his medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729,187)\c&H6F9B3F&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H18213A&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fs35}Time for Maomao's Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6F9B3F&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H18213A&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fs28\pos(732,84)}Time for Maomao's Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since ancient times, grasshoppers \Nhave been used as an ingredient in crude herbal medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They are said to be effective for relieving coughs and reducing fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He said his cough was terrible, \Nso I just prescribed a slightly larger dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that what it was?   
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good thing he's an idiot kid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, who was that old guy anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't it seem like he was trying to talk to me at first?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just your imagination. \NDon't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone around here is nothing but trouble.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,587)}{\fs50}{\b1\c&H18213A&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H18213A&\fnGeorgia}Next time:\NRobe of the Fire Rat{\fnBaskerville Old Face}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(644,425)\c&HFFFFFF&\fs40}To be continued
